Package: cpmnet
Title: Penalized Cumulative Probability Models with Elastic Net
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xuduo", "Wen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "wenv@usc.edu"))
Description: Fits cumulative probability models (CPMs) with elastic net
    penalization (regularization) along a full penalization path by block
    coordinate descent, with optional grouped penalization so that a
    categorical predictor is selected or dropped as a unit. Supports k-fold
    cross-validation for lambda selection under five criteria: the Brier
    score over a grid of response percentiles (the default), mean and
    median regression loss, pinball quantile loss, and the held-out
    log-likelihood, with probability scale residual criteria also
    available. The core fitting loop is implemented in Fortran.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    rms,
    PAmeasures,
    parallel
Suggests:
    MASS,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
